# Applies to repo-root-context image builds (the UI image). Keeps the context
# lean — no VCS metadata, submodules, vendored Go deps (not needed for the UI),
# node_modules, or prior build output.
.git
ai-review
docs
scripts
deploy
dev
**/node_modules
**/dist
src/api/vendor
src/ui/e2e
src/ui/playwright-report
src/ui/coverage
**/*.log
